 "about": "Shared cases for the overnight_postings alert's key and title (oe_connector/overnight.py, event_key and event_title). OpenExecutive accepts only this shape and drops any other event of the kind (ladislav-urban/OpenExecutive#294, integrations/erpnext_events.py). This file is byte-identical in both repositories: a change to the key, the title or a pattern lands in both together. oe_connector checks its builder emits exactly `produced` and that each fullmatches both patterns; OpenExecutive checks its patterns equal these, accept `produced` and reject `rejected`. Each produced case also carries totals_table, the third evidence table exactly as _event emits it (overnight.totals_table): the night's real counts, since the title caps at 9999 and OpenExecutive drops this kind's text; OpenExecutive feeds it to parse_evidence unchanged.",
